    "detailed_description": "Shuuen Shoujo is a thrilling action RPG featuring VTubers Sakuya and Tsumugi, who operate in the virtual space of Unreally. One day, Sakuya is selected as a beta tester for the latest game, Shuuen Shoujo, and she dives into its world alongside Tsumugi. This post-apocalyptic world is devoid of people and overrun with monsters. Together, they use their unique powers to fight back against the darkness and guide the World Tree towards its rebirth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay<br />\r\nStylish Action<br />\r\n'Shuuen Shoujo' offers players a wide array of action-packed maneuvers. Use these actions to battle your foes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStep: Evade enemy attacks and move swiftly.<br />\r\nJump: Reach higher grounds and leap over enemies.<br />\r\nGrappling Hook: Move quickly and attack distant foes.<br />\r\nPod Shooting: Suppress enemies from a distance with your pod.<br />\r\nProsperity System<br />\r\nCollect materials from monsters and rebuild the city to strengthen your stats. This prosperity system is crucial for advancing in the game:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMaterial Collection: Defeat monsters to gather materials.<br />\r\nCity Restoration: Use the collected materials to restore the city and enhance your stats.<br />\r\nStat Enhancement: As the city is restored, your abilities improve.<br />\r\nDiverse Monsters<br />\r\nThe game features over 10 unique monsters. Additionally, there are 100-monster and 1,000-monster defeat missions for those who love a challenge. Enjoy plenty of content to keep you engaged.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStory Mode<br />\r\nExplore the world of Shuuen Shoujo and relive the adventures of Sakuya and Tsumugi. Watch as their friendship and growth unfold while surviving in the post-apocalyptic world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShuuen Shoujo is packed with an epic storyline, diverse actions, and numerous challenges. Join Sakuya and Tsumugi on their journey to save the world!",
